{"id":"5772a390b9182440","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-language-constants.md","title":"Language with Constants Added","display":"df-language-constants — Language with Constants Added","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-language-constants","aliases":["17-df-language-constants"],"display":"df-language-constants — Language with Constants Added","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"1.3; 2.1","source_result":"Expansion convention; fresh constants in diagram construction","source_pages_print":[20,68],"source_pages_djvu":[36,84],"source_verification":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local five-component language construction","source_verification_history":["not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"],"legacy_label":"17-df-2.1.1","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-language-constants"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-language-constants</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language-constants — Language with Constants Added"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3; 2.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Expansion convention; fresh constants in diagram construction"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20</span><span>68</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>36</span><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local five-component language construction"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-2.1.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Name}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Name}_L\\)</span> 是由下式定义的集合到符号的可定义类函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 及序数后继见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_L\">\\(\\tau_L\\)</span> 的定义只用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L\">\\(\\Sigma_L\\)</span>，与被命名结构无关。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Log}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Log}_L\\)</span> (components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为一组新的常元符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L\">\\(\\Sigma_L\\)</span> 为含逻辑、非逻辑及标点符号的总字母表，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>。以下在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\cap\\Sigma_L=\\varnothing\">\\(C\\cap\\Sigma_L=\\varnothing\\)</span> 的输入域上定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(C)\">\\(L(C)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(C)\">\\(L(C)\\)</span> (language defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nH_L&amp;:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists a\\;((\\alpha,a)\\in\\Sigma_L)\\},\\\\\n\\tau_L&amp;:=(\\bigcup H_L)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)&amp;:=(\\tau_L,a),\\\\\n\\forall a\\;&amp;\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)\\notin\\Sigma_L,\\\\\n\\forall a,b\\;&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)\\leftrightarrow a=b\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nH_L&amp;:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists a\\;((\\alpha,a)\\in\\Sigma_L)\\},\\\\\n\\tau_L&amp;:=(\\bigcup H_L)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)&amp;:=(\\tau_L,a),\\\\\n\\forall a\\;&amp;\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)\\notin\\Sigma_L,\\\\\n\\forall a,b\\;&amp;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)\\leftrightarrow a=b\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;C\\cap\\Sigma_L=\\varnothing\n\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\nL(C)=\n\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\,\n\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup C,\\,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\,\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\,\n\\mathrm{Log}_L\n\\right\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;C\\cap\\Sigma_L=\\varnothing\n\\\\[-1mm]\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\nL(C)=\n\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\,\n\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup C,\\,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\,\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\,\n\\mathrm{Log}_L\n\\right\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Only the constant-symbol component changes.  In particular, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(C)\">\\(L(C)\\)</span> is not the\nset-theoretic union of a structured language tuple with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Name}_L$ 是由下式定义的集合到符号的可定义类函数；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 及序数后继见 [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。$\\tau_L$ 的定义只用 $\\Sigma_L$，与被命名结构无关。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (first-order language, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Log}_L$ (components of $L$, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$ 为一组新的常元符号；$\\Sigma_L$ 为含逻辑、非逻辑及标点符号的总字母表，见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]。以下在 $C\\cap\\Sigma_L=\\varnothing$ 的输入域上定义 $L(C)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Name}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Log}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_L","display":false},{"tex":"C\\cap\\Sigma_L=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"L(C)","display":false},{"tex":"L(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nH_L&:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists a\\;((\\alpha,a)\\in\\Sigma_L)\\},\\\\\n\\tau_L&:=(\\bigcup H_L)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)&:=(\\tau_L,a),\\\\\n\\forall a\\;&\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)\\notin\\Sigma_L,\\\\\n\\forall a,b\\;&\\bigl(\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)\\leftrightarrow a=b\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&C\\cap\\Sigma_L=\\varnothing\n\\\\[-1mm]\n&\\Longrightarrow\\quad\nL(C)=\n\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\,\n\\mathrm{Const}_L\\cup C,\\,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\,\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})_{n\\in\\omega},\\,\n\\mathrm{Log}_L\n\\right\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L(C)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":2369,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$T_{\\mathfrak A,B}$ 同时记录环境结构与参数集，$c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)$；该名字函数见 [[17-df-language-constants]]。$S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})$ 按 $L(C_B)$ 的语言实例解释，不是原语言的型空间。"},{"id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ 及总字母表 $\\Sigma_L$ 见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]；$\\mathfrak A=(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。对每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$，令 $c_a=\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)$，其中 $\\operatorname{Name}_L$ 是 [[17-df-language-constants]] 中已定义的规范新名字函数。$L(C)$ 取 [[17-df-language-constants]] 的常元扩张，$\\upharpoonright L$ 取 [[17-df-reduct]] 的语言约化。原子公式集 $\\mathrm{AtomForm}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$、句子集 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$ 与句子真值 $\\models$ 分别见 [[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-sentence]]、[[17-df-sentence-truth]]。以下定义 $C_{\\mathfrak A}$、$L(\\mathfrak A)$、规范命名扩张 $\\mathfrak A_{\\mathfrak A}$ 和 $\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)$。"},{"id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$T_{\\mathfrak A,B}$ 同时记录环境结构与参数集，$c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)$；该名字函数见 [[17-df-language-constants]]。$S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})$ 按 $L(C_B)$ 的语言实例解释，不是原语言的型空间。"},{"id":"fe3b669b17d273d8","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$c_{\\varphi,y}$ 与 $f_{\\varphi,y,\\bar x}$ 由下式的 $\\operatorname{Name}_L$ 构造，见 [[17-df-language-constants]]。它们是彼此不同且不在 $\\Sigma_L$ 中的符号；前者为常元，后者的正元数为 $n=\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar x)$。"},{"id":"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$T_{\\mathfrak A,B}$ 同时记录环境结构与参数集，$c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)$；该名字函数见 [[17-df-language-constants]]。$S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})$ 按 $L(C_B)$ 的语言实例解释，不是原语言的型空间。"},{"id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak C\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 且 $\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathfrak C)$，见 [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]。\n全载体加名采用 [[17-df-language-constants]]、[[17-df-diagram]] 的 $L(\\mathfrak C)$ 与规范扩张；$T_C,F_C$ 在下式定义。\n$\\operatorname{ElemDiag}$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-diagram]]，$\\mathrm{Form}_{L(\\mathfrak C),1}$、$S_1(T_C)$ 按加名语言实例取 [[17-df-type]] 的接口。\n$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\varphi\\in F_C$；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。\n$\\operatorname{Residual}_{\\mathfrak C}$、$\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}$、$\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}$ 按 $\\alpha$ 超限递归；$\\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathfrak C}$ 定义域为 $F_C$。\n本接口的 $-1,\\infty$ 是下式编码的两个非序数标记，不在此处进行整数运算或扩展实数运算。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[17-df-language-constants]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\